\nhttps://gitorious.org/~clepple/reposurgeon/clepple-nut-conversion\n\nThe Eaton_SDK branch had some content differences from the SVN repository, so\nit will be regenerated from git-svn patches.\n]]\n\nFossil-ID: SVN r2\n\nSVN-Git-Bridge: nut-3e341d2d9c-3fc79f1e8124 7f2965da1f3d0319d6a3cbd78399897ce29b8b10\nBridge-Author: Arnaud Quette &lt;arnaud.quette@free.fr&gt;\nBridge-Author-Date: 2005-01-27T14:33:14Z\nBridge-Committer: Arnaud Quette &lt;arnaud.quette@free.fr&gt;\nBridge-Committer-Date: 2005-01-27T14:33:14Z\nFrom: Arnaud Quette &lt;arnaud.quette@free.fr&gt;</msg>\n</logentry>\n</log>\n",
